  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 287.6pt, "Abstract")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 308.12pt, "Germanium-Tin (GeSn) semiconductors are promising for mid-infrared optoelectronics owing ")
  #line-at(72pt, 323.72pt, "to their silicon compatibility, tunable bandgap, and potential for room-temperature operation. ")
  #line-at(72pt, 339.32pt, "Released GeSn membranes provide an additional degree of freedom to extend the operation ")
  #line-at(72pt, 354.92pt, "wavelength through epitaxial strain relaxation, while their transferability expands design ")
  #line-at(72pt, 370.52pt, "flexibility. On the other hand, metasurfaces have become an effective strategy to engineer light-")
  #line-at(72pt, 386.12pt, "matter interaction, and their integration with photodetectors can enhance performance and ")
  #line-at(72pt, 401.72pt, "introduce new functionalities. Here, we demonstrate a mid-infrared photodetector consisting ")
  #line-at(72pt, 417.34pt, "of transfer-printed Ge")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.98pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(179.42pt, 417.82pt, "0.89")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(193.4pt, 417.34pt, "Sn")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.98pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(206.06pt, 417.82pt, "0.11")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(219.8pt, 417.34pt, " membrane integrated with a Au plasmonic metasurface. The ")
  #line-at(72pt, 432.94pt, "photodetector exhibits a wavelength cutoff exceeding 3.0 μm with nearly fourfold increase in ")
  #line-at(72pt, 448.54pt, "responsivity at 2.5 μm as compared to unreleased films, attributed to Fabry-Pérot resonance. ")
  #line-at(72pt, 464.14pt, "Furthermore, the integration with an anisotropic metasurface yields detectors with a strong ")
  #line-at(72pt, 479.74pt, "polarization sensitivity, achieving a measured contrast ratio of ~4:1 between orthogonal ")
  #line-at(72pt, 495.34pt, "polarizations. Furthermore, the operation wavelength of the photodetector can be selectively ")
  #line-at(72pt, 510.94pt, "tuned by varying the geometric scale of the metasurface. The experimental results show ")
  #line-at(72pt, 526.54pt, "excellent agreement with simulations, confirming the effectiveness and versatility of this ")
  #line-at(72pt, 542.14pt, "integrated metasurface-membrane design. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72pt, 585.34pt, "Keywords: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(135.56pt, 585.34pt, "Mid-infrared photodetector; Metasurface; Group IV semiconductors; GeSn ")
  #line-at(72pt, 600.94pt, "membrane; Polarization-sensitive detector ")
