  #line-at(72pt, 404.72pt, "resulting change in internal strain alters the band structure, leading to a substantial shift in the ")
  #line-at(72pt, 435.94pt, "GeSn layer's cut-off wavelength. Accurate simulations require precise refractive index data for ")
  #line-at(72pt, 467.14pt, "each material. However, the small size of the GeSn membrane makes it impossible to directly ")
  #line-at(72pt, 498.34pt, "measure the refractive index via ellipsometry. Consequently, we can only measure the ")
